{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おにぎりをいただきました!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2W0XE58S5QKXV56HH51Y1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のおすすめの具材は鮭です。\nたまーに、おかか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2W22Q5Q5XK4KVSFSNPD7P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、4、5個くらい食べれそうな気分( •̀ω•́ )✧\nやっぱり5個食べたい!\n4個より5個!4個より5個!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのぺーちゃん。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2W3HC662X7H6KRZ1RVT25","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺーちゃん とはりかちゃんのあだ名であって、また、りかちゃんが飼っているネコの名前です^._.^♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺーちゃん(猫)に会ってみたい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば最近、猫カフェに行きたいのですが、おすすめの場所ってありますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々なところにあって、今とても迷っています(￣- ￣ ) "},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猫が寄ってきてくれるところがいいなあ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動物に癒しを求めるなーこです。。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2W5973YTQCBG8GEKBK6T6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n雪を食べちゃう愛犬たち。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2W6PFGEAEAPRMMZQCAZA5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nマロンの鼻がハート(ᐥᐜᐥ)♡ᐝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪の足跡が最高です。\n足跡、見つけられますか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}